<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE - Hoogovens H1 net profit NLG 194 mln.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Hoogovens H1 net profit NLG 194 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BEVERWIJK, Netherlands 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1997.</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				   194     vs  139</p>
<p>    Net profit per share (guilders)	  5.74  vs    4.08</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)			  4.495 vs    3.773</p>
<p>    Operating profit			   330     vs  288</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast that steel and aluminium group Hoogovens NV would report a first-half net profit from ordinary operations of 162-205 million guilders, with a consensus forecast of 186 million.  </p>
<p>    Financial charges			   60     vs   70</p>
<p>    Tax					     91     vs   69</p>
<p>    Net profit on ordinary activities    178     vs  142</p>
<p>    Extraordinary items		 gain  13     vs    3 charge</p>
<p>    Minority interests		  credit 3     vs    nil</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
